:"to a map view. To use this protocol, you adopt it in any custom objects that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store or represent annotation data. Each object then serves as the source of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"information about a single map annotation and provides critical information,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as the annotation’s location on the map. Annotation objects do not provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the visual representation of the annotation but typically coordinate (in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conjunction with the map view’s delegate) the creation of an appropriate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"objects to handle the display."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNUserLocationAnnotationView":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"View representing an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNUserLocation","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" on screen.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"MLNUserLocationAnnotationView","fragments":[{"text":"MLNUserLocationAnnotationView","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnuserlocationannotationview","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNUserLocationAnnotationView"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNUserLocation":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNUserLocation","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnuserlocation","title":"MLNUserLocation","type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNUserLocation","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The MLNUserLocation class defines a specific type of annotation that identifies","type":"text"},{"text":" ","